The Mask Makers are a gang that works out of the golden jewelry districts of [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]]. Its members drive cars painted matte black with gold trim, colors that sit close to those of [[Divinity/Outer Gods/Judge of Ages|the Judge]]. Several of their cars have been seen at the [[Geography/Calaria/Ragged Roost|Ragged Roost]] pilgrimage.
